WEBVTT

00:04.130 --> 00:06.750
Shiraishi-kun, let's have a staring contest!

00:07.130 --> 00:09.420
Huh? A s-staring contest?

00:09.420 --> 00:10.880
Where'd that come from?

00:10.880 --> 00:13.920
Hmm, I'm just in the mood for one.

00:14.250 --> 00:16.630
O-oh, all right. Sure.

00:18.500 --> 00:19.790
Yay!

00:20.130 --> 00:21.920
Kubo-san looks happy.

00:22.460 --> 00:23.290
Here we go!

00:23.290 --> 00:25.500
Let's start on three.

00:25.670 --> 00:27.420
If you look away, you lose.

00:27.500 --> 00:27.960
Look away?

00:27.960 --> 00:29.420
One, two, three!

00:41.080 --> 00:42.130
Kubo-san.

00:43.670 --> 00:46.960
Aren't you supposed to make
funny faces during staring contests?

00:48.040 --> 00:52.880
For this type of staring contest, you lose
if you look away, not if you laugh.

00:52.880 --> 00:54.790
You don't need to make the other person laugh.

00:55.880 --> 00:56.960
I see.

00:58.040 --> 00:59.960
This could take a hot minute.

01:02.330 --> 01:02.960
Hm?

01:03.750 --> 01:07.460
I've never made eye contact with you this long before.

01:11.130 --> 01:12.420
Ah! You looked away!

01:12.420 --> 01:13.580
I win!

01:14.170 --> 01:16.040
That's not fair.

01:16.750 --> 01:18.880
Now, what shall I make you do?

01:18.880 --> 01:21.040
What? The loser has to do something for the winner?

01:21.170 --> 01:22.920
Yep, I decided that just now.

01:24.040 --> 01:25.670
That's…

01:27.250 --> 01:28.460
Ah, that's it!

01:28.830 --> 01:33.080
How about you say good morning to me first tomorrow?

01:35.750 --> 01:36.710
That's it?

01:38.250 --> 01:40.710
I can ask for more?

01:41.210 --> 01:43.670
Uh, that's not what I meant.

01:44.080 --> 01:45.670
Then that's what I want.

01:47.670 --> 01:49.420
Why does she want that?

01:51.580 --> 01:53.540
I can't wait for tomorrow!

01:56.960 --> 01:59.750
Jikan yo tomare

01:59.750 --> 02:03.790
Sukoshi dake

02:05.960 --> 02:09.380
Hajimari wa itsu datta?

02:09.380 --> 02:13.040
Mou oboetenai kedo

02:13.880 --> 02:17.630
Sore mo ii ka tte sa

02:17.630 --> 02:20.380
Taai mo nai koto

02:20.920 --> 02:23.960
Itsudatte ki ga tsukeba

02:23.960 --> 02:28.130
Waratte naitari shite

02:28.580 --> 02:34.080
Tamani iji hattari mo shitari ne

02:35.420 --> 02:45.330
Shingou ga kawareba seeno de susumu ikisaki (konomama)

02:45.330 --> 02:49.290
Iwanakutemo (dokomademo)

02:49.460 --> 02:52.420
Ikeru yo ne kitto

02:52.420 --> 02:56.080
Dramatic janakutemo

02:56.250 --> 02:59.920
Taikutsu da to nagetemo

03:00.210 --> 03:05.130
Itsuka futo omoidasu

03:05.580 --> 03:06.580
Kyou o

03:07.130 --> 03:10.880
Romantic na kotoba mo

03:11.040 --> 03:14.460
Nakute ii yo dakara

03:14.540 --> 03:17.210
Jikan yo tomare

03:17.210 --> 03:21.130
Sukoshi dake

03:21.630 --> 03:23.540
Tsubuyaita

03:26.630 --> 03:31.250
<b>Episode 10: Comparing Heights and Wall Pin</b>

03:30.130 --> 03:31.670
It's spring now.

03:32.330 --> 03:35.130
Hey, did you properly clean the chalkboard erasers?

03:35.380 --> 03:36.330
I did!

03:36.670 --> 03:39.170
All right, lemme check 'em.

03:40.540 --> 03:41.790
What did I say?

03:45.880 --> 03:50.830
While I was enjoying the spring air, I got covered
in chalk dust because they didn't notice I was right there.

03:53.330 --> 03:55.250
Whoa, sorry Shiraishi!

03:55.250 --> 03:56.670
I didn't see you there!

03:57.080 --> 03:58.750
It's cool, it's cool.

03:58.960 --> 04:00.080
Sorry!

04:03.960 --> 04:06.080
I think I got most of it off.

04:06.380 --> 04:08.670
I'll check in the bathroom mirror.

04:09.040 --> 04:13.250
Actually, never mind.
No one pays attention to me anyway.

04:13.790 --> 04:15.420
There's still chalk dust on you.

04:15.670 --> 04:16.880
Huh? Where?

04:17.170 --> 04:18.500
Kubo-san?

04:18.960 --> 04:21.040
That was quite the mishap you had.

04:21.330 --> 04:23.210
Thanks for letting me know.

04:23.460 --> 04:24.580
No problem.

04:25.080 --> 04:26.880
Where's the chalk dust?

04:27.330 --> 04:28.580
Want me to get it for you?

04:28.960 --> 04:30.170
Huh? That's okay.

04:30.500 --> 04:31.830
I can get it my-

04:37.710 --> 04:38.830
Don't move.

04:49.330 --> 04:50.330
I got it.

04:52.170 --> 04:53.460
Thanks.

04:56.500 --> 04:59.790
Your hair's thicker than I thought it'd be.

05:00.290 --> 05:02.080
It is?

05:02.330 --> 05:04.960
Yeah, compared to mine at least.

05:05.750 --> 05:06.790
Wanna touch it?

05:07.250 --> 05:08.830
Huh? Um…

05:09.380 --> 05:10.500
I'll pass.

05:10.710 --> 05:11.420
Go ahead!

05:16.750 --> 05:17.960
Kubo-san?

05:19.040 --> 05:20.040
What's wrong?

05:20.500 --> 05:21.540
Um…

05:22.380 --> 05:23.790
Don't keep me waiting!

05:50.170 --> 05:52.130
See? It's different, isn't it?

05:53.670 --> 05:54.460
Yeah.

05:54.790 --> 05:58.790
Shiraishi-kun, what kind of hairstyles on girls do you like?

05:59.130 --> 05:59.880
What?

06:00.130 --> 06:01.540
You're putting me on the spot,

06:02.170 --> 06:05.130
but I like any hairstyle if it suits her.

06:06.670 --> 06:08.420
If it suits her…

06:09.750 --> 06:11.750
Do you think pigtails suit me?

06:12.040 --> 06:12.790
Yeah.

06:12.790 --> 06:15.290
Do you think a braid or ponytail would suit me?

06:15.290 --> 06:16.000
Yeah.

06:16.710 --> 06:18.000
What about half-up, half-down hairstyle?

06:18.000 --> 06:19.250
Half-up, half-down?

06:19.460 --> 06:21.830
The hairstyle I wore at the picnic.

06:21.960 --> 06:23.000
Did it suit me?

06:23.250 --> 06:24.330
Oh, okay.

06:25.210 --> 06:25.830
Yeah.

06:26.580 --> 06:30.500
So out of all the hairstyles I listed,
which one is your favorite?

06:31.330 --> 06:32.130
Huh?

06:32.130 --> 06:33.210
Tell me!

06:40.170 --> 06:44.670
I think lots of guys like ponytails.

06:45.630 --> 06:47.040
Do you too, Shiraishi-kun?

06:53.250 --> 06:54.170
Yeah.

06:55.040 --> 06:55.960
Gotcha.

06:58.540 --> 07:00.170
Where are you going?

07:00.790 --> 07:04.670
I'm gonna make sure there isn't any chalk dust left on me.

07:05.580 --> 07:06.630
See you later.

07:18.040 --> 07:20.750
Maybe I'll put my hair in a ponytail tomorrow.

07:23.540 --> 07:27.380
Kubo-san's hair was so silky.

07:31.380 --> 07:33.210
Everyone, settle down!

07:33.630 --> 07:36.170
Tomorrow is physical exam day!

07:36.170 --> 07:38.630
Don't forget your track suits!

07:41.750 --> 07:44.000
I hope I got taller.

07:45.710 --> 07:48.000
Our physical exams are tomorrow, huh?

07:48.750 --> 07:49.670
Yep.

07:50.380 --> 07:53.580
Stare.

07:50.420 --> 07:53.580
<b>Stare</b>

07:51.500 --> 07:52.960
Wh-what?

07:53.580 --> 07:58.130
<b>Menacing</b>

07:54.040 --> 07:58.290
She's gonna say something like, "Shiraishi-kun,
looks like you haven't gotten any taller."

07:58.500 --> 08:00.960
Shiraishi-kun, did you get a little taller?

08:01.750 --> 08:02.420
Huh?

08:05.790 --> 08:06.920
What!

08:07.500 --> 08:09.330
Is it really that surprising?

08:10.040 --> 08:15.250
Because of my invisibility, no one outside
my family has ever pointed out I've grown taller.

08:15.630 --> 08:17.830
I guess a got a bit emotional.

08:18.380 --> 08:23.580
No one comments on my height or appearance because
they don't know what I looked like in the first place.

08:24.330 --> 08:25.920
That checks out.

08:27.250 --> 08:29.290
Do you think I've grown too?

08:31.500 --> 08:32.460
Grown…

08:32.710 --> 08:33.880
<b>Swoosh</b>

08:35.880 --> 08:38.750
You're still getting taller?

08:39.130 --> 08:41.170
Yeah. I got taller last year.

08:41.580 --> 08:42.790
Oh, I know!

08:47.330 --> 08:49.380
Let's compare heights.

08:49.750 --> 08:50.580
Huh?

08:51.290 --> 08:54.080
Maybe I'm the taller one.

08:54.750 --> 08:55.670
I don't know…

08:56.670 --> 09:00.290
<b>Heights last year</b>

08:57.080 --> 09:00.000
It's sad that I can't say for sure.

09:00.710 --> 09:02.920
You normally slouch, right?

09:05.080 --> 09:07.830
So you'll need to stand up straight.

09:08.960 --> 09:10.630
Hey, whoa there!

09:11.210 --> 09:12.130
Kubo-san!

09:13.460 --> 09:14.670
Did I startle you?

09:15.170 --> 09:17.920
All right! Stand with your back against the wall.

09:20.500 --> 09:22.460
She's absolutely toying with me.

09:23.670 --> 09:25.630
Hey, don't look to the side.

09:25.630 --> 09:28.790
You gotta face forward so the measurement is correct.

09:30.790 --> 09:34.000
Hmm, your head is tilted down a bit too much.

09:34.330 --> 09:36.040
Isn't just a rough estimate fine?

09:36.790 --> 09:38.920
That reminds me, Shiraishi-kun,

09:38.920 --> 09:43.880
your bangs are kinda long and hide
your face when you look down.

09:44.670 --> 09:46.710
Oh, they do?

09:47.880 --> 09:49.500
All right, finished!

09:50.330 --> 09:51.170
Okay.

09:51.580 --> 09:55.960
Keep the ruler still, and we'll compare my height to yours.

09:56.250 --> 09:57.130
All right.

10:12.790 --> 10:17.040
Hmm, Shiraishi-kun, you didn't move the ruler, did you?

10:18.170 --> 10:20.080
This is kinda like…

10:23.920 --> 10:25.210
Shiraishi-kun?

10:25.460 --> 10:27.210
Huh? Ah, sorry!

10:28.290 --> 10:28.920
What?

10:29.170 --> 10:31.710
I thought you'd run away.

10:33.750 --> 10:35.040
I can read you like a book.

10:37.210 --> 10:37.920
Dash!

10:37.920 --> 10:39.750
See, I knew you'd bolt as soon as I let go!

10:49.630 --> 10:51.960
I accidently took Kubo-san's ruler.

10:53.210 --> 10:54.710
I'll return it tomorrow.

11:10.920 --> 11:13.460
We were closer than I thought we'd be.

11:31.080 --> 11:32.460
I'm the first one here?

11:36.960 --> 11:37.830
Um.

11:39.790 --> 11:41.670
Oh, Shiraishi-kun!

11:42.210 --> 11:45.130
Er, good morning.

11:45.630 --> 11:46.330
Huh?

11:49.250 --> 11:51.290
Oh, the staring contest!

11:51.790 --> 11:55.290
I sorta promised to.

11:55.830 --> 11:57.460
You remembered.

11:57.710 --> 11:58.420
Yeah.

11:59.670 --> 12:01.750
Good morning, Shiraishi-kun.

12:03.750 --> 12:06.250
Oh, and also this.

12:06.540 --> 12:08.790
Oh, I totally forgot!

12:10.210 --> 12:11.330
Thank you!

12:15.290 --> 12:16.500
See you.

12:18.330 --> 12:19.830
Ah, good morning!

12:19.830 --> 12:21.420
Kubocchi, good morning!

12:21.420 --> 12:22.670
Yeah, good morning!

12:23.210 --> 12:25.460
What's up? Why're you grinning?

12:25.460 --> 12:29.500
Hm? I was just thinking that
today's gonna be a good day.

12:32.880 --> 12:35.580
It's finally physical exam day.

12:36.790 --> 12:39.630
After Kubo-san pointed out that I'd grown taller,

12:39.630 --> 12:44.710
I noticed my tracksuit is a little less baggy
than it was when I started high school.

12:46.210 --> 12:47.920
You look happy.

12:48.080 --> 12:49.330
Did something good happen?

12:49.580 --> 12:51.170
Nah, not really.

12:52.540 --> 12:53.830
Well, from what I can tell,

12:54.750 --> 13:00.250
you're tickled pink because you've grown,
and now your tracksuit fits perfectly.

13:00.420 --> 13:03.130
No, I don't think it fits perfectly!

13:03.130 --> 13:05.080
It's still a little too big.

13:07.130 --> 13:07.750
Ah.

13:08.250 --> 13:10.210
I called it!

13:10.460 --> 13:12.040
I walked right into her trap!

13:12.830 --> 13:15.540
Oh, gimme your tracksuit jacket for a sec.

13:15.830 --> 13:16.580
Huh?

13:16.750 --> 13:21.580
After all, we didn't determine who's
taller yesterday, so this will settle it.

13:22.250 --> 13:23.880
That's true.

13:24.380 --> 13:25.290
Er, but…

13:27.880 --> 13:30.790
I want to wear your track jacket.

13:33.630 --> 13:34.540
Please.

13:38.080 --> 13:38.920
All right.

13:42.170 --> 13:43.040
Thank you!

13:45.040 --> 13:46.580
Nah, it's nothing.

13:49.170 --> 13:50.500
Here's my jacket.

13:50.750 --> 13:51.830
Thanks!

13:53.250 --> 13:56.040
Dang, it's baggier than I expected.

14:01.920 --> 14:04.380
It looks like you're taller.

14:06.830 --> 14:07.920
Yep.

14:11.750 --> 14:12.790
Kubo-san?

14:13.790 --> 14:17.130
Shiraishi-kun, hurry! Physical exams are about to start!

14:17.500 --> 14:18.920
We gotta hurry to the gym!

14:18.920 --> 14:20.380
Huh? Ah, um…

14:20.670 --> 14:21.750
Kubo-san, my track jacket!

14:22.460 --> 14:23.790
I'm borrowing it for a bit.

14:22.920 --> 14:24.000
<b>Grin</b>

14:24.710 --> 14:26.000
Ah, Kubo-sa-

14:27.830 --> 14:28.960
Seriously?

14:34.210 --> 14:36.380
Phew, made it just in time!

14:36.380 --> 14:38.250
Kubocchi, you took your sweet time.

14:38.250 --> 14:38.790
Yep.

14:38.790 --> 14:39.880
Sorry, sorry!

14:40.170 --> 14:44.920
Ah, I stopped getting taller,
but I'm worried I gained weight!

14:44.920 --> 14:46.540
I didn't eat breakfast.

14:46.830 --> 14:49.710
Tama! Will you survive until lunch?

14:49.880 --> 14:53.670
I can't eat whatever and not get fat like you, Kubocchi.

14:53.670 --> 14:56.710
Nagisa doesn't seem to fret over her weight.

14:57.420 --> 14:59.130
Yeah, but…

14:59.580 --> 15:03.040
I can't put on weight in the areas I want to.

15:03.830 --> 15:04.710
Her boobs?

15:05.420 --> 15:06.540
Def her boobs.

15:07.710 --> 15:08.670
Hmm?

15:09.130 --> 15:12.210
Am I imagining things or is your track jacket big today?

15:12.580 --> 15:14.420
Huh? Really?

15:14.670 --> 15:15.790
It totally is.

15:15.790 --> 15:16.710
Right!

15:17.630 --> 15:20.130
I'm wearing my sister's today.

15:20.460 --> 15:21.540
Maybe that's why.

15:21.540 --> 15:25.380
Ah, your sister is taller.

15:25.380 --> 15:27.670
So she went to this high school too?

15:27.880 --> 15:29.380
Yeah, she did.

15:30.250 --> 15:34.460
But I thought there was a decent age gap
between Nagisa and her sister.

15:35.420 --> 15:36.540
Well, whatever.

15:36.880 --> 15:39.750
What? You're wearing your
boyfriend's track jacket today?

15:39.750 --> 15:40.880
Yep, I am!

15:40.880 --> 15:43.460
No wonder you smell different than usual.

15:43.710 --> 15:47.920
Oh yeah, track jackets normally smell
like your house or yourself.

15:47.920 --> 15:49.040
True, true!

15:49.040 --> 15:50.920
Yeah. It's kinda soothing.

15:57.290 --> 16:03.790
<b>Name</b>

15:57.290 --> 16:03.790
<b>Height</b>

15:57.290 --> 16:03.790
<b>Shiraishi</b>

15:59.290 --> 16:03.790
<b>Incidentally</b>

16:00.420 --> 16:03.790
<b>Shiraishi</b>

16:00.420 --> 16:03.790
<b>hit five</b>

16:00.420 --> 16:03.790
<b>foot five!!</b>

16:01.040 --> 16:01.880
I'm taller!

16:03.790 --> 16:05.420
<b>Name</b>

16:03.790 --> 16:05.420
<b>Height</b>

16:03.790 --> 16:05.420
<b>Kubo</b>

16:03.790 --> 16:05.420
<b>Tamao</b>

16:03.790 --> 16:05.420
<b>Hazuki</b>

16:05.500 --> 16:09.790
<b>They didn't get taller.</b>

16:06.080 --> 16:08.000
We're not any taller!

16:20.290 --> 16:21.460
Good morning!

16:23.420 --> 16:24.670
Good morning.

16:25.210 --> 16:26.290
What's this?

16:26.290 --> 16:29.540
It's early in the morning,
and you're reading my magazine.

16:30.500 --> 16:32.880
I wasn't really. I was just leafing through it.

16:33.250 --> 16:35.880
There's nothing to be embarrassed about.

16:36.170 --> 16:38.460
You're already a second year in high school.

16:39.080 --> 16:40.880
Geez, Akina!

16:47.040 --> 16:48.790
She's turned into such a cutie.

16:49.540 --> 16:51.960
Time really flies!

17:02.920 --> 17:04.420
Hey, kiddo.

17:04.420 --> 17:06.460
Why are you hiding?

17:06.830 --> 17:08.790
K..Kubo-san's sister?

17:09.170 --> 17:11.580
Oh, sorry about the picnic.

17:11.750 --> 17:15.290
I don't remember what happened,
but I really pissed off Nagisa.

17:15.290 --> 17:16.580
Oh, it's oka-

17:17.380 --> 17:18.130
Oh!

17:17.380 --> 17:18.130
<b>Gasp</b>

17:19.540 --> 17:20.540
What's wrong?

17:21.040 --> 17:22.960
Oh, actually this is

17:23.580 --> 17:25.380
Seita-kun's first errand by himself.

17:26.170 --> 17:27.500
I gotcha.

17:27.830 --> 17:31.710
But since you're invisible, you don't need to hide, right?

17:31.960 --> 17:32.750
Nope, I gotta hide.

17:33.130 --> 17:36.880
Oh, can Seita-kun see you because you're family?

17:37.420 --> 17:42.420
No, just because I'm related to someone
doesn't mean they can necessarily see me.

17:42.750 --> 17:43.380
Huh?

17:44.420 --> 17:50.330
When I've spent a lot of time with someone,
they develop a resistance against my invisibility.

17:50.750 --> 17:54.630
It's like how your eyes get acclimated to the dark.

17:54.960 --> 17:57.130
Ah. That's rough.

17:59.080 --> 18:01.040
His very first errand, huh?

18:01.790 --> 18:03.080
That takes me back!

18:03.080 --> 18:06.630
I think I remember being worried about Nagisa
and following her on her first errand too.

18:07.210 --> 18:08.000
Really?

18:08.670 --> 18:10.920
Green light!

18:08.790 --> 18:12.630
He's crossing the street with
his hand up. Such a good boy!

18:15.170 --> 18:16.290
Are you getting emotional?

18:16.710 --> 18:17.420
Yes.

18:18.630 --> 18:21.460
Even though it's just a one or two minute walk for us,

18:21.460 --> 18:24.290
it's a huge adventure for Seita-kun.

18:25.330 --> 18:28.250
Speaking of which, why are you here?

18:28.250 --> 18:29.080
Oh,

18:29.580 --> 18:32.580
I need to do some shopping at the same store too.

18:34.500 --> 18:36.000
There are eggs!

18:37.380 --> 18:39.170
You're so grown-up!

18:40.130 --> 18:44.130
He's still small, so I thought he might not be able to do it.

18:44.380 --> 18:46.580
I know what you mean.

18:46.920 --> 18:50.750
Before you know it, they're capable of all kinds of stuff.

18:51.170 --> 18:52.250
Tank you!

18:52.960 --> 18:56.830
Now he's just gotta go back home. I guess he'll be okay.

19:03.330 --> 19:04.580
What's wrong?

19:04.580 --> 19:06.420
Oh. No, it's nothing.

19:06.960 --> 19:08.210
Big bwutha!

19:09.000 --> 19:10.790
I bought eggs!

19:11.790 --> 19:13.500
That's awesome, Seita!

19:13.500 --> 19:15.040
Oh! Hewwo!

19:15.040 --> 19:16.670
Hello, Seita-kun.

19:16.880 --> 19:20.170
Oh, I'm so happy you did it all by yourself!

19:23.880 --> 19:26.830
This reminded me a little of Nagisa's first errand.

19:26.830 --> 19:28.880
Her being all by her lonesome made me anxious.

19:29.170 --> 19:30.420
Really?

19:32.130 --> 19:36.130
Actually, Nagisa's bought eggs on her first errand too.

19:36.130 --> 19:37.000
Ah!

19:38.710 --> 19:43.210
She made it to the store,
but she fell down on the way back home.

19:44.210 --> 19:46.420
Almost all the eggs broke.

19:47.710 --> 19:48.460
Really?

19:48.460 --> 19:51.210
She managed to make it home, but…

19:52.380 --> 19:53.670
Welcome back, Nagisa.

19:54.000 --> 19:55.420
Akina!

19:55.920 --> 20:01.460
I twipped and the eggs bwoke.

20:02.960 --> 20:04.290
I see, I see.

20:06.000 --> 20:08.210
Thank you for going shopping for me.

20:08.630 --> 20:09.630
You did a great job.

20:11.670 --> 20:16.420
Let's make fluffy omurice with
lots of eggs for lunch today.

20:17.250 --> 20:22.830
She bawled so hard,
but she stopped when I stroked her head.

20:22.830 --> 20:24.460
I guess she was an easy kid.

20:27.540 --> 20:30.750
Knowing her now, it's impossible to imagine that.

20:31.040 --> 20:33.210
Really? Well, guess it would be.

20:33.790 --> 20:38.000
Ah! I'm sure even now if
you stroked her head she'd stop crying.

20:38.330 --> 20:40.460
You should give it a shot if you get the chance.

20:40.460 --> 20:41.250
What?

20:42.080 --> 20:44.920
She likes having her head stroked.

20:45.170 --> 20:46.580
Er, um…

20:47.790 --> 20:49.250
Give it a shot…

20:51.330 --> 20:54.830
Actually, if she does cry,
I'm counting on you to do that, kiddo.

21:01.250 --> 21:03.130
That's kinda, er…

21:03.750 --> 21:06.330
A lot. That's a big responsibility.

21:07.500 --> 21:08.960
You'll manage somehow.

21:10.830 --> 21:12.040
I'm home!

21:13.000 --> 21:13.960
Welcome back!

21:14.630 --> 21:18.040
Seita-kun went on his first errand alone today.

21:18.210 --> 21:19.420
Oh, did he?

21:19.630 --> 21:24.380
Ah, it reminded me of when
you came home with broken eggs!

21:24.630 --> 21:28.880
Removing the egg shells so
I could make omurice was quite the task.

21:29.210 --> 21:32.960
That happened so long ago!
I'm nothing like I was back then.

21:33.830 --> 21:35.630
Oh, are you now?

21:37.000 --> 21:37.830
What?

21:38.330 --> 21:39.460
She's glad.

21:40.290 --> 21:43.670
You might would enjoy it more
if your crush was the one rubbing your head.

21:49.460 --> 21:52.540
Hey, who did you imagine just now?

21:53.920 --> 21:55.580
Hey, c'mon! Tell me!

21:56.080 --> 21:58.170
I didn't imagine anyone!

21:59.250 --> 22:05.750
Oh, I was planning on making omurice
with lots of eggs for lunch,

22:05.750 --> 22:07.460
if that sounds good to you.

22:08.040 --> 22:10.040
Seriously? C'mon, Akina!

22:11.080 --> 22:14.460
Akanesasu kousha no kage

22:14.460 --> 22:20.750
Mitsukaranai hazu no seishun no hashikko ni

22:21.000 --> 22:26.170
Sukoshi suwareta kamo, kedo sugu kiechau kamo

22:26.170 --> 22:30.420
Kimi ga waraikakete kureru koto mo

22:30.420 --> 22:32.330
Kirei da ne

22:32.330 --> 22:35.170
Kiseki tte yonde ii kana

22:35.420 --> 22:41.080
Konna hibi ga suki da yo, suki da yo, sukida yo

22:41.080 --> 22:47.540
Datte zutto tsuzuku wake janai kara, dakishimeru no

22:47.540 --> 22:51.670
Kodomo kara chotto fumidashita haru no hi ni

22:51.670 --> 22:55.040
Susume, susume, susume, ippo zutsu

22:55.040 --> 22:58.380
Ima kasuka de tashikana kaze ga fuku

22:58.380 --> 23:06.040
Semete boku to kimi no aida wa sekai ga sukoshi irozukimasu youni

23:06.040 --> 23:10.670
Donna canvas o egaku kana, donna mirai ni naru kana

23:10.670 --> 23:14.460
Wakaranai kedo shinjite mitaina

23:13.750 --> 23:18.040
Egao de te o futtara kitto

23:14.830 --> 23:17.880
Jaa mata ne to ie tara

23:17.880 --> 23:21.580
Ashita ga sukoshi tanoshimi ni naru ne

23:21.670 --> 23:28.540
Kisetsu no hayasa ni sotte, kotoba kasaneru bokura

23:28.540 --> 23:34.960
Douka douka shiawase de arimasu youni da ne
